gantt
    title Triage, one 2.5 s budget: Haiku says high, Sonnet checks
    dateFormat x
    axisFormat %S.%L s
    section Orchestrator
    waits for the triage motor (max 2.5 s)   :o1, 0, 2500
    section Triage motor
    Haiku answers high in 0.9 s               :done, h1, 0, 900
    Sonnet gets the 1.6 s left, answers in 1.2 s :active, s1, 900, 2100
